msgid "Per-conflict apply decisions: an array of {path, decision} entries. `decision` is `keep_yours` or `use_core`."
msgstr "Decisiones de aplicación por conflicto: un array de entradas {path, decision}. `decision` es `keep_yours` o `use_core`."

