#: includes/class-wc-privacy.php:128
msgid "We accept payments through PayPal. When processing payments, some of your data will be passed to PayPal, including information required to process or support the payment, such as the purchase total and billing information."
msgstr "Aceptamos pagos mediante PayPal. Al procesar pagos algunos de sus datos se pasarán a PayPal, incluida la información requerida para procesar o dar soporte al pago, tales como el total de la compra y la información de facturación."

#: includes/gateways/bacs/class-wc-gateway-bacs.php:64
